# random — random N produces a value from 1 to N; seed fixes the sequence

seed: 42

var roll

verb roll
    takes noun
    "Nothing to roll."

room Casino "A smoky casino."

    object die "A six-sided die."

        instead of roll:
            roll = random 6
            say "You roll {roll}."

test "default"
    roll die. "You roll 5."
